[[Lost Orrian Jewelry Box]]es are [[container]]s offered for {{karma|4550}} at any karma [[vendor]] in [[Ruins of Orr|Orr]]. They drop [[item]]s including high-end [[crafting material]]s, [[liquid karma]], an exotic [[miniature]], and, most likely, [[junk]].

== Acquisition ==
{{Sold by}}

== Contents ==
;Liquid karma
* {{contains|Drop of Liquid Karma|qty=2, 3}} <small>({{karma|600}})</small>
* {{contains|Taste of Liquid Karma}} <small>({{karma|2500}})</small>
* {{contains|Vial of Liquid Karma}} <small>({{karma|3750}})</small>
* {{contains|Swig of Liquid Karma|qty=1-2, 4}} <small>({{karma|4500}})</small>

;Materials
* {{contains|Obsidian Shard}}
* {{contains|Charged Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Crystal Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Destroyer Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Glacial Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Corrupted Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Molten Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Onyx Lodestone}}
* {{contains|Pile of Putrid Essence}}

;Junk
* {{contains|Unidentifiable Object|qty=2-3, 5, 10, 20|chance=Guaranteed}}

;Everlasting Potions
* {{contains|Warm Potion}}
* {{contains|Hard Potion}}
* {{contains|Charged Potion}}
* {{contains|Cold Potion}}

;Miniatures
* {{contains|Mini Risen Priest of Balthazar}}

== Notes ==
* One set of karma potions and one set of other items are acquired each time a box is opened.
* Based on the research listed here, the resultant cost of each box is roughly 2000 karma due to the "reimbursement" from liquid karma.
* Drop research can be found [[/Drop rate|here]].

{{Drop rate lookup table|style=hom|manual totals=yes|minimum amount=0.009}}

== Trivia ==
* Lost Orrian Jewelry Boxes were introduced with the [[Game updates/2013-01-28|January 28, 2013 game update]].

